{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1000_null", "source_sha256": "8d86f1e1de78b2e73b8604a8b6703ffd6cf86ccab7225a859198114f9bfb1e88", "ja": "撮影会から数日後……", "zh": "摄影会结束几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "c56e47929050f0c2340b09bd6669f12b47f3ec6a134adf31e76941a773b52917", "ja": "今日はいい天気だネ～。\nプロデューサー、どこにお出かけするノ？", "zh": "今天天气真好呀～  \n制作人，你要去哪儿玩呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "abf843388c4e32dc3fcd648b12d98baa0422594574300adc3b83b2e7f0c5be3f", "ja": "はは、お出かけじゃなくて仕事だぞ。\n今から行くのは出版社！", "zh": "哈哈，不是出门玩，是工作啦。现在要去的是出版社！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "c68f3a25709896053221fdd5ef215cb8db752d22741e5f51d206236798b8de04", "ja": "Team6thの撮影会、大盛況だったからな。\n雑誌で特集してくれるそうなんだ。", "zh": "Team6th的摄影会反响很热烈呢。\n说是杂志要给我们做特辑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "d75a153b4769ef51fbf2e5d98805ae3756408368e38c98c0ecb50105199019cf", "ja": "ワオ！　もしかしてインタビューってこと？", "zh": "哇！难道是要接受采访？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "a382ffe6b185a7c944bd235fa0808f9d915250c6f5e416bda9314536b489e223", "ja": "そういうこと。今日はエレナに、\n撮影会の思い出をたくさん話してもらうからな！", "zh": "就是这样。今天要让艾莲娜好好讲讲拍摄会的回忆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "72dfb159135cb5cf2fdad4342b67f0342c5cd29f1dbc173ca8985bd5d3d2e657", "ja": "そっか～。ン～、撮影会の思い出……\nなら、やっぱりサンバの話！", "zh": "这样啊～。嗯～，拍摄会的回忆……\n那果然还是得说说桑巴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "d6f1e18b5d11efdc2749a9de4d210d29d780c16e57db5849951d4ddc451e7f43", "ja": "ワタシが踊ってたら、ファンのみんながどんどん\n集まってくれて、すっごく盛り上がったよネ！", "zh": "我跳着跳着，粉丝们也纷纷聚了过来，现场气氛超热烈的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "2f4d132c797cb9bc2b2b327fbc57581f6faa067fd630d7835a03f44924d080bc", "ja": "あ、今日の取材の人も一緒に踊ってくれるカナ？\nそしたら、楽しさが全部伝えられると思うヨー！", "zh": "啊，今天来采访的人也会一起跳舞吗？\n这样的话，我觉得就能把这份快乐全部传达出去啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "d9367f1814ba6b654c2c381aaeeff1189882173cc3e26b91281d7ff89d86648e", "ja": "ど、どうかな？\n取材の人に踊ってもらうのは、難しいかも……。", "zh": "不、不知道呢？\n让采访的人跳舞，可能有点难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "fd0351a3d8714f4a417428d6af5e323f36045c8f5016bf95d34ec87f1dfc7736", "ja": "そうなノ？　うーん、それじゃあ……\n撮影のポーズのお話とか！", "zh": "是这样吗？嗯——那就聊聊拍摄时摆姿势的话题吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "bd36ba659ef88b3a37585e519e44af304b54a9bd06a2cd4de29845e0e988487b", "ja": "ポーズ？　ああ、ファンの希望に応じて、\nみんな色々なポーズをしてたよな。その話か？", "zh": "姿势？啊，之前大家都会按照粉丝的要求摆出各种姿势。你说的是这个吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "1f86028ed9c146ec8208c1696acfc3636bf459e40b6ce761317117dde86af92c", "ja": "ウン、マツリがいろいろ教えてくれたノ！\n指で作るハートには、いっぱい種類があるんだヨ♪", "zh": "嗯，祭教了我好多东西呢！\n原来用手指比出的爱心也有好多种♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "18287afa3ed793a7a983c1dd11d81162067abee4109510a950ef45a2d4f72b33", "ja": "あと、優雅なお姫様のポーズとか、\nカワイイ妖精さんのポーズも教えてもらったり～。", "zh": "另外，她还教了我优雅公主的姿势，还有可爱小精灵的姿势～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "8a9e6bd8b4f294f70a3339392038616a62b4e1f2351aa9d25946543215ca6670", "ja": "他にも、チームのみんなで考えたけど、没になった\nポーズもあったり。……そういうお話でいい？", "zh": "还有一些姿势，是队里的大家一起想出来的，不过最后没被采用……讲这些内容可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "3c0001dbf7bc2c5c527f06c7a2a5779b9116e523b71f846be9adb84eeaa4d211", "ja": "うん、すごくいいと思う！　没ポーズの話なんて、\nいかにも裏話っぽいし。先方も喜んでくれそうだ。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得非常好！废弃姿势之类的话题，\n一听就很有幕后花絮的感觉。对方应该也会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "b2160979b19123c8f3af3381d03f46df3640a2a4f4a2bc7a8d0c7b9f6cf7e83f", "ja": "ホント？　ハッピーになって、笑ってもらえる？", "zh": "真的？能让对方开心地笑出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "7b9b4ebcc4f8ad408bbaf145bca0e0cb4786a6a10385a434303b91cf224335b7", "ja": "？　取材の人に、笑ってもらいたかったのか？", "zh": "？是想让采访的人笑吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "eebf7b82439d96ed540aebec297718fb4c9c0e9a37b700d364243a60188838da", "ja": "もちろんだヨー！　撮影会もそうだったでしょ？\nワタシ達とダンスしたり、おしゃべりしたりして～。", "zh": "那当然啦～！摄影会的时候不也是那样吗？\n跟我们一起跳舞、聊天什么的～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "c32a88c03bdaa682dab52f45b83ac6656a5f0dd6f07d1e604c056468308d3467", "ja": "みーんなで笑って、ハッピーになれたんだもん！\nだから今日の取材の人も、ハッピーにしなくちゃネ！", "zh": "大家一起笑着，变得超级开心了嘛！\n所以今天来采访的人，也一定要让他们开心起来才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1020_401pro", "source_sha256": "289f7c42b1975c997d7c34d26ecc1426ce7bbfe5f3f39d7a647cfb228cf3d78b", "ja": "はは、なるほどな。ファンだけじゃなくて、\n仕事相手の人も笑顔にする、か……。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。不只是粉丝，\n还要让工作上的伙伴也露出笑容吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "c762d4d3a028b42df9b3ee0480e519b841aa75628b7263bd65b2e1381fbeb79f", "ja": "そうだよな。エレナと関わる人、みんなを仲間にしてい\nこう。今日もしっかり、笑顔になってもらおうな！", "zh": "是啊。把和艾丽娜打交道的人，全都变成我们的伙伴吧。今天也要好好让他们露出笑容！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0433_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0433_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "cbed3fcffa2e19ca3e3a6730c8a6d695ca12d80ed79b4ca83d77ad8785ece1d5", "ja": "ハーイ！　プロデューサーも、素敵な笑顔だネ！\nエヘヘ、……よかった♪", "zh": "嗨！制作人也笑得很棒呢！\n嘿嘿……太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
